Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Add a unit test for decoding H.264 frames above 1080p

Decodes a flat grey IDR frame at 1920x1080 and at 2560x1440 through
H264Decoder into a black pixel buffer and checks three pixels. Before the
previous commit the 2560x1440 case fails on Windows with all pixels still
black; both pass with it. The frames are under 1 KB each.
